Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.99,0:00:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bilang punya tujuan, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku datang untuk menyelamatkanmu\Ndari dimensi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyihir, aku menyukaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maukah kamu ikut denganku ke dimensiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyihir, aku menyukaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maukah kamu ikut denganku ke dimensiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Romansanya sudah dimulai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menolak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.71,0:02:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimensi ini sudah jadi rumah keduaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak bisa kutinggalkan begitu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, aku sudah memahami segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahwa semua ini adalah ulahmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, jadi kamu sudah menyadarinya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang Suci sekaligus putri pertama\NKerajaan Runeberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, sifat aslimu sangat jahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam-diam berbuat licik,\Nmembawa maut dan perang di duniamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri paling jahat sepanjang sejarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri Melvocia R. Runeberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bereinkarnasi ke dunia ini\Ndemi membunuhmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini serasa takdir, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Romansanya sama sekali tidak terasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka kematian dan kekacauan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin lebih banyak kematian terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sebabnya aku memicu peperangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam-diam bersekongkol dengan musuh,\Nmendukung kekaisaran agar perang meluas,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lalu membakar dunia sampai hancur.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melihat negaraku diserang\Ndan hancur berantakan...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagiku itu sangat menyenangkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan konyol! Kamu sadar berapa banyak\Norang menderita dan sedih karena itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, Ryusei juga...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau cuma disebut penjahat ulung,\Nsepertinya itu masih kurang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ja-Jangan konyol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.89,0:03:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tujuan aslimu sebenarnya hal lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tebakanmu tepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agar bisa bereinkarnasi,\Ndibutuhkan sekitar 10.000 jiwa, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memanfaatkan hasil penelitianmu\Ntentang reinkarnasi tanpa izin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkat itu,\Naku bisa berenikarnasi ke dunia lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini semua berkat dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak seperti di sini,\Ndimensi bagi kejahatan bisa menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai wanita jahat di Earth 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, pintu neraka sudah terbuka lebar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena tak sanggup menanggung\Ntabrakan banyak dimensi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dunia pun berakhir retak!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama celahnya masih terbuka,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kekacauan akan terus membesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat, celah retakan dimensi itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti bendungan yang hampir runtuh, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dinding dimensinya retak...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu serius ingin menghancurkan dunia ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga sudah memikirkan kemungkinan\Nkalau kamu bereinkarnasi ke dimensi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini aku datang jauh-jauh ke sini\Ndemi menghancurkan dunia bersamamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu memang wanita yang sangat jahat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu pujian terbaik yang kuterima.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sempat bingung, tapi sekarang lega\Nkarena bisa selesai dengan kekerasan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ucapanmu seram!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yakin bisa melawanku\Ndengan kondisimu sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Brave Jammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemampuan curang untuk menghambat\Nkekuatan sang Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini ulahmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali, pedang sang Pahlawan\Ntak akan bisa menyentuhku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beraninya kamu menyerang Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Purification!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu lupa kekuatan Gadis Suci-ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasukan mayat hidupmu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tak akan mempan melawanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini gawat, Kesatria Mayat Hidup\Nsudah dilenyapkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor dibuat tak berdaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu musuh adalah Gadis Suci gila\Ndengan kemampuan curang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal ini reuni kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebaiknya kita bersenang-senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini, aku juga punya kesenangan baru,\Nmerebut hal-hal yang berharga bagimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Holy Bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kabur, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teleportasi berhasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus!\NAku memang hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita sedang di atap gedung OZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untungnya teleportasi kita\Nberhasil tepat waktu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Amou?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian harus berterima kasih padaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar, kenapa kalian tiba-tiba bertarung\Ntanpa persiapan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Celah itu sama seperti celah dimensi\Ndunia kami hampir hancur.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, para Penyihir OZ\Nsedang mencari solusi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi waktu kita makin mepet\Nsebelum dimensi ini hancur!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jelaskan, siapa sebenarnya gadis itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia putri yang sangat suka\Nkematian dan keputusasaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Reinkarnasi wanita jahat dari dimensi lain\Nyang datang menghancurkan dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kita bisa menang?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuatan analisis mutlak:\NDunia Ini Milikku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir Gadis Suci yang membasmi kejahatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu kekuatan misterius\Nyang menetralkan sihir milik Amou...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk kekuatan Gadis Suci,\Nmasih bisa kita lawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kalau saja aku bisa bertarung...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau saja kita bisa mengatasi\NBrave Jammer tadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Kalian tak bisa\Nmenangkal Brave Jammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di dunia lain itu sudah kemampuan wajib.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Brave Jammer dikembangkan khusus\Nuntuk melawan pahlawan reinkarnasi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}penangkal curang yang melumpuhkan\Nsemua kemampuan curang pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penangkal curang?\NItu sama saja bisa melakukan apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia asalku sempat sangat kacau karena harus\Nmengatasi para pahlawan yang kelewatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi penyebabnya bukan karena puber?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu terlalu polos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya trik khusus\Ndari duniaku untuk melawannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong, bantu aku agar bisa bertarung lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, para pria tolong pergi dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tidak boleh mengintip!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.85,0:08:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.55,0:08:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tanda suci penangkal Brave Jammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, kekuatan pahlawanmu\Ntak akan bisa dia hilangkan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunjukkan padaku,\Nbahwa pahlawanlah yang akan menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak akan bisa menikah lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja, pasti ada pria\Nyang punya selera unik.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa dengan langitnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seolah-olah dunia akan runtuh sekarang juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu!\NApa yang sudah kamu perbuat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, si Penyihir dan sang Pahlawan\Nmasih belum pulih?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia ini akan hancur dalam satu jam,\Napa mereka bisa sempat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudah, aku akan main-main\Ndulu dengan kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.51,0:09:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tanya apa yang sudah kamu perbuat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akulah pembawa maut\Ndan kekacauan bagi dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, inilah akhir dari dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wanita ini... dia sudah gila.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takigawa Minto, Kuraishi Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian diizinkan memakai\Nlingkaran sihir tingkat empat ke atas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.77,0:10:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerahkan semua kemampuan\Nuntuk menghentikan wanita jahat itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Niat kami memang begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tahu tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kisah reinkarnasi wanita jahat pun\Nbutuh karakter yang melawannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Ini zirah terbaikku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang benar saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Momennya tidak tepat untuk membahas itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Celah dimensi yang kita hadapi\Nkali ini bukan celah biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asahina-san bilang, makin terbuka penampilanku,\Nmakin besar kekuatan sihirku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih mau terus bahas itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus bergegas.\NAku cemas dengan Takigawa dan Kuraishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:10:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin dengar
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pendapatmu yang sebenarnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu... terlihat sangat imut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sampai sulit fokus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.49,0:11:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang kumaksud itu bukan zirahku!\NTapi terima kasih atas pujiannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri yang jadi dalang perang itu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}juga alasanmu bereinkarnasi, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, untuk apa kamu menjadi Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblis, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia hanya orang bodoh yang tak mampu\Nmenyelamatkan apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.49,0:11:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia gagal melindungi kerajaannya\Ndan tak sadar niat buruk Putri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah, dia memberikan pengetahuan\Nyang dibutuhkan Putri untuk bereinkarnasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat aku sadar perang adalah cara Putri\Nuntuk mengumpulkan banyak jiwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}semuanya sudah terlambat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu semua salahku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sebabnya kamu bereinkarnasi mencarinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bereinkarnasi agar bisa\Nmengalahkannya di kehidupan dan dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar bodoh! Kamu tak bisa\Nmenanggung semuanya sendirian!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita juga punya orang sama bodohnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pahlawan yang juga bereinkarnasi\Ndemi mengejar Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik! Jangan bilang aku sama bodohnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yakin mau menyamakan dirimu\Ndengan Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah semua ini selesai,\Naku akan balas budi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bicara seolah ingin mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan mengorbankan dirimu\Ndemi mengalahkannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akulah yang akan mengalahkanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri punya penangkal curang\Nyang luar bisa kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tetap harus siap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa bertarung bersama sang Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada yang lebih membuatku tenang
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}selain bertarung bersamamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa bilang hal seperti itu\Ndengan muka datar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor bilang dia akan membantumu\Nmenyelesaikan masalah ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa cara bicaramu begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, mari kita selamatkan dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oi, jangan terlalu dekat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir Gabungan: Fire Tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan Serangan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sama sekali tak terluka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyerapan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan sihir kalian sangat kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi itu tak akan mempan\Nmelawan kemampuan curangku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantulan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minto, kamu baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penguatan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengisian Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.89,0:13:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tak akan pernah bisa mengalahkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku Gadis Suci\Nsekaligus wanita jahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tahu dari mana wanita jahat\Nmendapatkan kekuatannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mendapatkannya
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dari keputusasaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita datang tepat waktu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf membuat kalian menunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya kalian datang juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sempat cemas kalian tak akan datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu lama, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak akan kubiarkan\Nkamu menghancurkan dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian sudah menyiapkan cara\Nmenghadapi Brave Jammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanaori, kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takanashi-san sudah berusaha maksimal\Nagar aku bisa bertarung lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa pakai zirah bikini?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua mengungsilah\Nyang jauh dari sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai sekarang,\Nbiar kami yang mengatasinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati, dia curang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan sihir tak mempan\Ndan bisa pulih dengan cepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak perlu cemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblis dan sang Pahlawan bekerja sama.\NMustahil kami akan kalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu dulu! Kamu akan bertarung\Ndengan penampilan seperti itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa malah bengong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa boleh buat,\Nkamu butuh bantuan penyihir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini spesial!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kuberi transformasi khusus untukmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Battle Dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, mari kita mulai pertarungannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini imut banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat bersenang-senang!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, kamu sangat imut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kita mulai dengan tarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jreng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Holy Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Darkness Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergi sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tangkisan Serangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih lemah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan Beruntun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tangkisan Serangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan Balasan Otomatis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Corpse Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan ini?\NSemua serangan kita tidak mempan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan sihir tingkat 9\Nmilikku pun bisa dia tahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemulihan Stamina, Resistan Racun,\NPemulihan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inilah kemampuan curang\Nyang kudapatkan setelah bereinkarnasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku wanita jahat terkuat\Nyang tak terkalahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar tidak adil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia itu sebenarnya apa?\NMustahil bisa kita kalahkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Curang! Curang! Curang! Curang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak adil karena dia memang curang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Reinkarnasi memang menyebalkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jaga ucapanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga setuju.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rapalan Sihir Instan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat diriku yang terlalu kuat ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Darkness Wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana dengan rencananya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum siap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, aku akan mengulur waktu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.53,0:17:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penguatan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Thor Hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Laevateinn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sangat menyebalkan, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tak berdaya menghadapi\Nkemampuan curangku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, bukan berarti\Nkamu tidak bisa dikalahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Death Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Resistan Kutukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Poison Squall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penawar Racun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pandemic Fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Resistan Rasa Sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Deadly Mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah merapal beberapa sihir\Nuntuk mengujinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekuat apa pun kemampuan curangmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}efeknya hanya bertahan delapan detik.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kamu hanya bisa mengaktifkan\Ntiga kemampuan curang otomatismu sekaligus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan ini, kamu akan—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seluruh stadion ini\Nsudah menjadi tanah suci.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tak bisa lagi mengandalkan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sihir berbahayamu itu, Penyihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Curang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku akan terus menyerangmu\Nsampai tak mampu menahannya lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rapalan tiga lapis, aktif serempak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Poison Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shadow Lance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Grude Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Resistan Racun, Resistan Serangan Mental,\NResistan Kutukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan Sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia Ini Milikku: Kemampuan Gadis Suci\Nyang mampu melihat segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.51,0:18:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sadar serangan beruntunmu tak akan kuat\Nmengalahkan kemampuan curangku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seranganmu tadi hanya untuk mengulur waktu
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}agar sang Pahlawan bisa menyerangku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lima kali.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebanyak itulah kemampuan curang\Nyang bisa kugunakan sekaligus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali, serangan kalian\Ntak akan bisa melukaiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang menang, Penyihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan Proyektil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sebabnya aku sudah menyiapkan\Nserangan lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mustahil!\NDari mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya melempar batu kerikil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi itu tetap serangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyihir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bilang,\Nkalau Raja Iblisku memang hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sangat seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:20:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga kita bertemu lagi, rival cintaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak mau kita bertemu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita menang!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa zirah dia selalu\Nada kain yang kurang?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita berhasil mengalahkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita beruntung karena dia tak punya\Nbanyak pengalaman bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kita pasti kalah kalau dia bisa\Nmemanfaatkan kemampuan curangnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya beban berat yang kupikul hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.73,0:22:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kamu kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya, kamu menghadapi semua ini sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bertarung sendirian, bahkan menjadi\NRaja Iblis, dan bereinkarnasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.68,0:22:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hidupmu pasti sangat kesepian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa malah kamu yang menangis?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.51,0:22:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini, tisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.03,0:22:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, aku tidak kesepian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.45,0:22:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menjadi Raja Iblis ternyata lumayan juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga menghargai pertarunganku denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.95,0:22:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlebih, kamu sampai susah payah\Nmencariku ke dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.09,0:22:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu karena aku memang pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, sang Pahlawan Meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku senang dipertemukan denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya berakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih belum!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu lupa?\NAkulah yang akan membunuhmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?\NAku lupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, sebaiknya lupakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.03,0:23:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu memang baik!
